 ('How do dates and scheduled downloads work?', 'Upload dates filter the original video publication date. A scheduled batch starts at your selected future time while NexaTik remains open and the laptop stays awake and connected to the internet. Closing the app cancels its pending schedule.'),
 ('Why does Instagram open a browser?', 'In version 0.5.2, Instagram profile links use a visible Chrome Reels scan, with Edge as a launch fallback. Complete any requested login or verification in that browser. The scan waits up to three minutes and collects visible Reels; complete profile coverage is not guaranteed.'),
